<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You might not have known this, but almost 40% of our clients at Memphis Invest live in California and invest with our team in our 5 investment markets: Memphis, Dallas-Ft. Worth, Houston, Oklahoma City, and Little Rock.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Why do so many people from the Golden State choose Memphis Invest?&nbsp; You already know the answer, but have you ever seen the math that makes it such an easy decision to invest outside your home area?</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial"><b><u>Your money just goes a lot farther with us, plain and simple</u></b>. You wouldn't want to buy a $100-200k property in most parts of California even if you could find one. One client said to me years ago, "For $150k I couldn't buy a dog house in a war zone in California."</font></div><div><br></div><div>Let's do a simple side by side comparison.<b><u><a href="https://www.redfin.com/CA/Los-Angeles/15728-Vintage-St-91343/home/5700933"> <span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255);">This link shows</span></a></u></b><span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255);"> </span>you a typical 3/2 outside Los Angeles price right at $600,000, in a pretty nice area as far as I can tell. Using Rentometer, the average expected rent for this property would be $2,567/month.</div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(102, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(102, 255, 255);"><b><u><a href="https://www.trulia.com/rental/4039259753-1508-Taylorcrest-Dr-Dallas-TX-75253">This link takes you to a property</a></u></b> </span>that a Memphis Invest client recently acquired at the $150k price point in our Dallas market. This property will rent for $1395/month.</div><div><br></div><div>What seems like the best investment decision to you? Acquire the 1 California property for $600k, put all your eggs in that 1 basket, collect $2567/month and then pay state income taxes on it, or...</div><div><br></div><div>With that same $600k, you acquire 4 properties just like this one in Dallas and collect a total of <b><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">$5180/month,</u></b> while also diversifying your risk across 4 properties rather than just one.</div><div><br></div><div>Oh yeah, I should remind you that Texas has extremely landlord friendly laws and no state income tax.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>I'll wrap it up now because I know you get the point.</div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If you are tired of sitting on the sidelines and you&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">are ready to talk about taking the next steps and start building your portfolio, then&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style=""><u style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 51);">&nbsp;<a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bea0-baba97f6-16a5bdc5-baba97f6-00000003-akh1jtljgb2avjcra3athdno4hnubpbd&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1" style="">please use this link to schedule a call with me</a></u></b><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;in the next few days.</span></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Looking forward to hearing from you.&nbsp;</span></div><div><br></div><div>Take care.</div><div><br></div><div>Marq</div><div><br></div><div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><br></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">--&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><br><div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 1.5pt;"><table style="border: none; border-collapse: collapse;"><colgroup><col width="209"><col width="217"></colgroup><tbody><tr style="height: 0pt;"><td style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><img src="https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/35Bpxe6cI59b7SPd1Ls3kCrKpkmOaeSlmXP5Cvr_dTlqpQ_NaEFimCr0Ptt6OKA5X8LT7AOk9kkY3lxI4bGUQtXBbZSp-UdEeVW2yNcMLvA6WC-7_50X5mHg09uMFju18M3oavOM" width="185" height="134" style="border: none;"></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center;"><font color="#1155cc" face="Trebuchet MS"><span style="font-size: 12px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><b><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/marq-cobb-one-to-one" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">Get to Know Marq Cobb</a></b></span></font><br></p></td><td style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; border-width: 1pt; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: top; padding: 5pt;"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Marq Cobb</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style=